# Google OAuth client ID (Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials).
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the value. `.env*.local` is gitignored.
#
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID of type "Web application" with these authorized
# JavaScript origins:
#   https://hmugatu.github.io
#   http://localhost:5173
#
# The client ID is not a secret — it ships in the client bundle by design. There
# is no client secret: this is a public browser client using the Google Identity
# Services token flow, scoped to `drive.file` (only files this app creates).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
